  "description": "This deposited report audits the MillenniumLean package's claims about six Clay Millennium Problems. It reports a pinned-toolchain examination of eleven files and fourteen itemized findings, distinguishing kernel acceptance from whether a theorem states and resolves the intended mathematical problem. The author's reported verdict is that none of the six problems is resolved by that package. This catalog refresh checks the deposited text and provenance; it does not independently rerun Lean or recertify either the package or the audit.",
